 Dear  Rachel Christian 
 
 Thank you, I=E2=80=99m really pleased to confirm your deposit has been rec=
eived
for your stay at Bont=C3=A9 arriving on Sunday the 2nd May 2027 for 7 night=
s. 
 
 You have a wonderful holiday to look forward to!  Bont=C3=A9 is located in=
 a
very special part of the world and I want your time there to feel
effortless, relaxed and genuinely memorable.
 
 Most guests arrive with plans but quickly settle into a relaxed rhythm;
slow mornings with coffee on the terrace, time by the pool, exploring local
markets and vineyards.  Evenings tend to end the same way, outside with a
drink watching the sun set over the vineyards.
 
 Once the final payment has been made, due 8 weeks before your stay, your
booking will be fully confirmed.
 
 I will then share the house check-in details and in the weeks counting
down to your stay, I will send some ideas to help shape your stay,
everything you need for a smooth and relaxing holiday. 
 
 It might be some time from booking your holiday to the final payment, for
some guests this is over a year.  Please feel free to contact me if you
have any questions at all, I will always be here to help you.  The website
www.bontemaison.com will be updated regularly with new guest reviews,
holiday ideas and how we are continuously adding new features to the house
and gardens.  
 
 If you need a hire car from Bordeaux airport, have a look at prices on our
availability page here:  Availability - Bonte
<https://www.bontemaison.com/availability>
 
