Dear &nbsp;Rachel Christian&nbsp;<br>
<br>
Thank you, I’m really pleased to confirm your deposit has been received for your stay at Bonté arriving on&nbsp;Sunday the&nbsp;2nd May 2027 for&nbsp;7 nights.&nbsp;<br>
<br>
You have a wonderful holiday to look forward to!&nbsp; Bonté is located in a&nbsp;very special part of the world and I want your time there to feel effortless, relaxed and genuinely memorable.<br>
<br>
Most guests arrive with plans but quickly settle into a relaxed rhythm; slow mornings with coffee on the terrace, time by the pool, exploring local markets and vineyards.&nbsp; Evenings tend to end the same way, outside with a drink watching the sun set over the vineyards.<br>
<br>
Once the final payment has been made, due 8 weeks before your stay, your booking will be fully confirmed.<br>
<br>
I will then share the house check-in details and in the weeks counting down to your stay, I will send some ideas to help shape your stay, everything you need for a smooth and relaxing holiday.&nbsp;<br>
<br>
It might be some time from booking your holiday to the final payment, for some guests this is over a year.&nbsp; Please feel free to contact me if you have any questions at all, I will always be here to help you.&nbsp; The website www.bontemaison.com will be updated regularly with new guest reviews, holiday ideas and how we are continuously adding new features to the house and gardens.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>
<br>
If you need a hire car from Bordeaux airport, have a look at prices on our availability page here:&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://mandrillapp.com/track/click/31067093/www.bontemaison.com?">Availability - Bonte</a><br>
<br>
In the meantime, here are some helpful links to get started with ideas:-<br>
<br>
